<h3>The Sun</h3>
<p>Keith wrote for <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Herald_and_Weekly_Times">The Herald and Weekly Times</a> from 1946 to 1978, most notably in <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Sun_News-Pictorial">'The Sun News-Pictorial</a>'s 'A Place in the Sun' from 1958 to 1978.</p>



<h3>Walkabout Magazine</h3>
<p>Keith wrote for <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Walkabout_(magazine)"> Walkabout Magazine</a> between 1962 and 1969</p>
