<h3>The Bulletin</h3>
<p>Keith wrote in <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bulletin_(Australian_periodical)">The Bulletin</a> from 1962 until 1984, initially under the psuedonym, 'Batman'.</p>
    {% include 'snippets/bulletin.njk' %}
